00:53:47,510 --> 00:53:52,870
I was going to make the statement that it seems that security is more of a cultural than a technical problem.

436
00:53:52,870 --> 00:54:01,030
But I think what we just talked about hits on the fact that sometimes there are technical barriers to changing the culture and I'm curious to get your thoughts on that as a last statement.

