00:54:33,990 --> 00:54:38,950
Even if that culture is technical, I think that is worth pointing out.

445
00:54:38,950 --> 00:54:52,069
There will be a lot of technical work but for that technical work to be fruitful you need to have a no blame high corporation psychological safe culture because if

446
00:54:52,079 --> 00:55:01,430
you haven't got that and someone says that I think our application design does not really make it easy to change passwords in runtime

447
00:55:01,430 --> 00:55:10,870
then it might be perceived as you trying to wake criticism goes to chief architect and that chief architect might get etc., etc., and things get sour.

448
00:55:10,870 --> 00:55:18,790
And this has also been studied in research that organization that are able to promote a high trust environment

449
00:55:18,790 --> 00:55:27,109
where you can feel your concerns and get them listened to and have an open discussion do display a lot higher security.

450
00:55:27,109 --> 00:55:37,349
So I think of culture as the fundamental to be able to do technical work at all in a high quality fashion.

