00:55:37,349 --> 00:55:41,589
And then you get to be able to do all those technical stuff that gives security.

452
00:55:41,589 --> 00:55:46,630
But technical excellence without a culture is not possible.

453
00:55:46,630 --> 00:55:50,230
And uh cultural excellence without any technical knowledge at all will not yield security.

454
00:55:50,240 --> 00:55:51,910
So it's a both end.

